h:976px;"><div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.1fr) minmax(0,0.9fr); gap:40px; align-items:center;"><div><div class="auto-eyebrow">Automotive · Power Modules</div><h1 style="font-family:var(--font-display); font-size:40px; font-weight:700; color:var(--ink); line-height:1.06; letter-spacing:-0.03em; margin:0 0 18px; text-wrap:balance;">Power modules for electrified vehicles</h1><p style="font-size:16px; color:var(--ink-2); line-height:1.65; margin:0; text-wrap:pretty;">Hana&rsquo;s OSAT operations in Thailand and China cover IGBT and SiC power devices from <a href="/capabilities/osat/package-design">package design</a> and thermal simulation through to module assembly and test. For EV programs, that covers modules and discretes for traction inverters, on-board chargers and DC-DC converters.</p></div><div style="position:relative; overflow:hidden; border-radius:10px; border:1px solid var(--line); background:#fff; aspect-ratio:16/9;"><img src="/images/photos/mk-automotive-power-modules-open-top.webp" alt="Open-top view of an assembled power module showing die attach and interconnect" style="width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; display:block;"/></div></div></div><div style="position:relative; z-index:1; padding:20px 48px; max-width:976px;"><div class="auto-sechead"><h2>What we build for EV powertrains</h2></div><div class="auto-buildsheet"><div class="auto-buildrow"><div class="lab"><h3>Traction inverters</h3></div><p class="desc">Custom SiC modules, plus the HP1 and HPD formats.</p></div><div class="auto-buildrow"><div class="lab"><h3>On-board chargers and DC-DC converters</h3></div><p class="desc">Easy 2B modules.</p></div><div class="auto-buildrow"><div class="lab"><h3>AEC-Q101 power discretes</h3></div><p class="desc">TO-247, D2PAK-7L and TSPAK, Hana&rsquo;s patented top-side cooling package.</p></div></div><div style="display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px; margin:18px 0 28px;"><a href="/capabilities/osat/power-packages#power-modules" cla